      "text": "[6:16PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nSignificant traffic congestion at Oyebanji Roundabout route connecting Adeniji Adele Road via Oba's Palace and Police Post, resulting from ongoing construction activities.\nHeavy traffic volume at Tinubu Square, extending to Nnamdi Azikiwe Street en route Tom Jones Intersection, due to the influx of commuters during the evening rush hour.\nSlow traffic movement beneath Idumota Bridge, specifically on the inward journey to Eyin Eyo and connecting to Balogun and Martins Streets, attributed to market activities and frequent bus stops in the area.\nFluid traffic flow observed on Illubinrin ascending Carter Bridge, with a smooth inward journey to Ijora Olopa, as well as on the Oyingbo route.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
